# GitHub Linguist configuration
# Treat .ec files as C++ for language statistics
*.ec linguist-language=C++

# Or if you want them as a separate language but not counted in stats:
# *.ec linguist-vendored

# Ignore build artifacts from language stats
*.o linguist-vendored
*.obj linguist-vendored
*.ll linguist-vendored
*.pdb linguist-vendored
*.exe linguist-vendored

# Documentation
*.md linguist-documentation